/F1 16 Tf (Acme Corporation Employee Policy Handbook) Tj T* /F1 11 Tf
/F1 13 Tf (Section 1: Working Hours & Remote Work) Tj T* /F1 11 Tf
(Welcome to Acme Corporation. This handbook outlines operational policies.) Tj T*
(1.1 Working Hours) Tj T*
(Standard business operations occur Monday through Friday.) Tj T*
(Employees must be available during core hours of 10:00 AM to 4:00 PM.) Tj T*
(Total mandatory working commitment is 40 hours per calendar week.) Tj T*
(Flexible starting times are permitted between 8:00 AM and 10:00 AM.) Tj T*
(1.2 Remote Work Policy) Tj T*
(Acme Corporation supports a hybrid workplace arrangement.) Tj T*
(Employees can work remotely up to 2 days per week with prior manager approval.) Tj T*
(Remote workstations must adhere to information security standards.) Tj T*
(Employees must log in to the enterprise VPN during all remote hours.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
