/F1 16 Tf (Acme Corporation Employee Policy Handbook) Tj T* /F1 11 Tf
/F1 13 Tf (Section 2: Leave & Time-Off Policy) Tj T* /F1 11 Tf
(2.1 Annual Paid Vacation Leave) Tj T*
(Full-time employees receive 20 days of paid annual leave per calendar year accrued monthly.) Tj T*
(Leave requests exceeding 3 consecutive days must be submitted 14 days in advance.) Tj T*
(A maximum of 5 unused annual leave days can be carried forward to the following year.) Tj T*
(2.2 Sick Leave & Medical Circumstances) Tj T*
(Employees are granted 10 days of paid sick leave annually.) Tj T*
(Sick leave exceeding 2 consecutive days requires a certified doctor note.) Tj T*
(Unused sick leave expires on December 31st and is not eligible for cash encashment.) Tj T*
(2.3 Parental & Maternity Leave) Tj T*
(Maternity leave provides 16 weeks of fully paid leave for eligible birth parents.) Tj T*
(Paternity leave provides 4 weeks of fully paid leave following childbirth or adoption.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
