/F1 16 Tf (Acme Corporation Employee Policy Handbook) Tj T* /F1 11 Tf
/F1 13 Tf (Section 3: Attendance Calculation & Overtime) Tj T* /F1 11 Tf
(3.1 Attendance Calculation Methodology) Tj T*
(Attendance is calculated monthly based on biometric badge swipes and portal check-ins requiring at least 8 hours per day.) Tj T*
(Grace period for daily arrival is 15 minutes past the agreed schedule.) Tj T*
(Accumulating three unexcused tardy instances within a single calendar month incurs formal counseling.) Tj T*
(3.2 Overtime Regulations) Tj T*
(Overtime beyond 40 weekly hours is paid at 1.5 times the standard hourly rate.) Tj T*
(All overtime work requires pre-authorization in writing from the Department Director.) Tj T*
(Salaried exempt managerial employees are not eligible for overtime compensation.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
