/F1 16 Tf (Acme Corporation Employee Policy Handbook) Tj T* /F1 11 Tf
/F1 13 Tf (Section 4: Security Badges & Information Governance) Tj T* /F1 11 Tf
(4.1 Physical Security Badges) Tj T*
(Security access badges must be prominently worn and visible at all times within corporate premises.) Tj T*
(Loss must be reported immediately to Facilities within 2 hours; a $20 replacement fee applies.) Tj T*
(Employees are strictly prohibited from tailgating or admitting non-badged visitors without front desk escort.) Tj T*
(4.2 Data Confidentiality & Device Protection) Tj T*
(Company laptops must utilize full-disk BitLocker encryption.) Tj T*
(Storing confidential customer records on personal flash drives or unauthorized cloud drives is strictly forbidden.) Tj T*
(All intellectual property conceived during tenure remains exclusive corporate property.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
